nsition-all\">Taffy</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Thimble</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Tot</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Twinkle</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Wisp</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ad-slot my-8 mx-auto max-w-[728px] \" data-ad-position=\"content\"><div class=\"border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center h-[90px] text-gray-400 text-sm select-none\">Ad - After Name Lists (300×250)</div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions About <!-- -->Algae Octopus<!-- --> Names</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What makes a good algae octopus name?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A good name matches personality, is easy to pronounce, and ideally 1-2 syllables.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Should I name based on appearance?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes! Distinctive features make wonderful naming inspiration.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can I use a human name?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely. Human names are popular and make bonds feel more personal.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">How many names to consider?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Shortlist 3-5 favorites, test them over several days.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What sounds work best?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Names ending in vowel sounds, especially &#x27;ee&#x27;, work best for recognition.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">📖 <!-- -->Algae Octopus<!-- --> Naming Guide</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->1</span><span>Observe behavior before naming.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->2</span><span>Choose easy-to-pronounce names.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->3</span><span>Two syllables work best.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->4</span><span>Test for a full week.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->5</span><span>Avoid command-like sounds.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->6</span><span>Involve family in naming.</span></li></ul>